## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical skills in designing a multi-tenant, event-driven API on GCP using API Gateway, Cloud Tasks, and Cloud Run, with per-tenant isolation and observable patterns. It focuses on real components, trade-offs, and testability.

## Key Concepts
- API Gateway
- Cloud Tasks
- Cloud Run
- per-tenant isolation (buckets and service accounts)
- idempotent processing
- observability (Cloud Logging/Monitoring)

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo dedupe check against Firestore
async function isDuplicate(eventId, tenantId) {
  const doc = await Firestore.collection('dedup').doc(`${tenantId}_${eventId}`).get();
  if (doc.exists) return true;
  await Firestore.collection('dedup').doc(`${tenantId}_${eventId}`).set({ seenAt: Date.now() });
  return false;
}
```

